"工作方式" = "How it works";
"CellDock 在 Mac 上开一个仅模组可达的 SOCKS5 中继，并让模组侧 vowifi-go 运行时通过它把 IKEv2 与 ESP 送到运营商 ePDG。SIM/ISIM AKA、SWu 隧道和 IMS 注册都由该运行时完成；此后端仍处于实验阶段，需要真实 SIM、运营商和 ePDG 联调验证。" = "CellDock opens a SOCKS5 relay on this Mac that only the module can reach, and the module-side vowifi-go runtime sends IKEv2 and ESP to the carrier ePDG through it. SIM/ISIM AKA, the SWu tunnel, and IMS registration are all handled by that runtime. This backend is still experimental and needs validation with a real SIM, carrier, and ePDG.";
