"上游必须是支持 UDP ASSOCIATE 的 SOCKS5 代理；IKEv2 与 ESP 共用同一个 UDP 关联，以保持 ePDG 看到的 NAT 映射稳定。" = "The upstream must be a SOCKS5 proxy that supports UDP ASSOCIATE. IKEv2 and ESP share one UDP association so the ePDG keeps seeing a single stable NAT mapping.";
