"VoWiFi 已注册" = "VoWiFi registered";
"vowifi-go 在 Mac 的特权网络进程中运行，通过受限桥向模组请求 SIM/ISIM AKA，并在 Mac 上建立 utun、SWu/ePDG 隧道和 IMS 注册。可选的 SOCKS5 上游只承载 IKEv2 与 ESP；模组固件无需修改。此后端仍处于实验阶段，需要真实 SIM、运营商和 ePDG 联调验证。" = "vowifi-go runs in the Mac's privileged network process, requests SIM/ISIM AKA from the module through a restricted bridge, and establishes utun, the SWu/ePDG tunnel, and IMS registration on the Mac. An optional SOCKS5 upstream carries only IKEv2 and ESP; no module firmware changes are required. This backend remains experimental and requires validation with a real SIM, carrier, and ePDG.";
